t before the two mechanisms are fixed at their owners with $0 proofs: the root/driver pair collapsed to the narrower question by code (identity, D207's rule), the figure-line clause reworded and proved on re-sent stored v92 requests, and the base text (v53 against v66 under the architecture) put to Alex.
